    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82364" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περι-τήκω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>melt, melt away</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν σίδηρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Vict.</u>
					1.13
				</span></i>
			 ; <i>wash away</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Criti.</u>
					112a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν σωμάτων τὰ νοσερά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herod.Med.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				10.40.1
			</span></i> :—
				Pass.
			, with pf. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέτηκα</span>, <i>melt entirely, melt away</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ χιὼν π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.648c
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιτετηγμένον ὀστέων πῆγμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>4 Ma.</u>
					9.21
				</span></i>
			 ; <i>become emaciated</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prorrh.</u>
				2.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SD</u>
				2.13
			</span></i> ; <i>to be washed away</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mir.</u>
				833b7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι καττιτέρῳ π</span>. <i>cover with a
				coat</i> of tin, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Criti.</u>
				116b
			</span></i>.</div>
